OpenVPN native binaries (libovpnexec.so, libopenvpn.so)
=======================================================
Extracted from F-Droid package de.blinkt.openvpn ("OpenVPN for Android" /
ics-openvpn by Arne Schwabe), which embeds OpenVPN under the GNU GPL v2
(with additional terms from the OpenVPN project).

Source: https://github.com/schwabe/ics-openvpn
F-Droid: https://f-droid.org/packages/de.blinkt.openvpn/
Refresh: native/openvpn/fetch-ics-openvpn-libs.sh

Shipping these binaries with OnionVPN requires GPL compliance for the
combined work as it applies to the OpenVPN portion (offer corresponding
source, preserve licence notices).
